OL,3,CWhat does Nigel Farage's by-election
OL,4,Cwin mean for probe into his finances?
OL,6,FNigel Farage has been reelected as MP
OL,7,Ffor Clacton, after resigning amid
OL,8,Fongoing scrutiny over a #5 million
OL,9,Fgift from British-Thai billionaire
OL,10,FChristopher Harborne.
OL,12,FFarage stood down last month, saying
OL,13,Fhe wanted to fight a "people versus
OL,14,Fthe establishment" contest, putting
OL,15,Fthe judgment over his finances to the
OL,16,Fpeople of Clacton instead.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/14
