OL,3,CWhat does Nigel Farage's by-election
OL,4,Cwin mean for probe into his finances?
OL,6,FThe Reform UK leader secured a
OL,7,Fcomfortable win with 62% of the vote,
OL,8,Fbut all of the main political parties
OL,9,Fchose not to field candidates against
OL,10,Fhim, describing the by-election as a
OL,11,F"political stunt".
OL,13,FSo what happens now Farage is back and
OL,14,Fcould the people of Clacton end up at
OL,15,Fthe polls again this year?
OL,17,FWhy did Farage step down?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
