OL,3,CWhat does Nigel Farage's by-election
OL,4,Cwin mean for probe into his finances?
OL,6,FNigel Farage stood down as an MP last
OL,7,Fmonth, quickly announcing he would
OL,8,Fstand for reelection in the same
OL,9,Fconstituency in the ensuing by-
OL,10,Felection.
OL,12,FThe Reform UK leader had been under
OL,13,Finvestigation since May by the
OL,14,Fparliamentary standards commissioner
OL,15,Fover a gift of #5 million he received
OL,16,Fbefore being elected in 2024, and
OL,17,Fwhich he failed to declare upon
OL,18,Fentering the Commons.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
