OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786753075
OL,3,CWhat does Nigel Farage's by-election
OL,4,Cwin mean for probe into his finances?
OL,6,FHis resignation as MP paused that
OL,7,Finquiry, which has now be re-opened by
OL,8,Fthe parliamentary standards commission.
OL,10,FUnder Commons rules, new MPs are
OL,11,Frequired to register any gifts worth
OL,12,Fmore than #300 they received in the
OL,13,Fprevious year, within one month of
OL,14,Ftaking office.
OL,16,FPurely personal gifts that have no
OL,17,Frelation to political or parliamentary
OL,18,Factivities do not need to be
OL,19,Fregistered.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
