OL,3,CWhat does Nigel Farage's by-election
OL,4,Cwin mean for probe into his finances?
OL,6,FFarage has repeatedly insisted he has
OL,7,Fdone nothing wrong, and claimed he
OL,8,Fwanted voters to "be the judges of my
OL,9,Factions".
OL,11,FWhat happened at the by-election?
OL,13,FAfter Farage triggered the by-
OL,14,Felection, all major parties took the
OL,15,Fdecision not to field candidates,
OL,16,Finstead accusing him of creating a
OL,17,F"publicity stunt" aimed at
OL,18,F"distracting" from the parliamentary
OL,19,Finvestigation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
