OL,3,CWhat does Nigel Farage's by-election
OL,4,Cwin mean for probe into his finances?
OL,6,FFarage did not attend the election
OL,7,Fcount where his victory was announced,
OL,8,Famid claims of an "organised campaign"
OL,9,Fthat sought to "humiliate him" at the
OL,10,Fresults.
OL,12,FA Reform UK spokesperson said Essex
OL,13,FPolice had reported a "credible
OL,14,Fthreat", but the force said it had not
OL,15,Fadvised any candidates about attending
OL,16,Fthe count.
