OL,3,CWhat does Nigel Farage's by-election
OL,4,Cwin mean for probe into his finances?
OL,6,FEssex Police said: "The decision of
OL,7,Fcandidates to attend or not attend the
OL,8,Felection count is a decision for
OL,9,Findividuals and their security teams,
OL,10,Four role is to make sure our policing
OL,11,Foperation is sufficiently robust to
OL,12,Fensure the safety of all, and we are
OL,13,Fgrateful to all of our officers, staff
OL,14,Fand the staff at Tendring District
OL,15,FCouncil who worked through the night
OL,16,Fto ensure the safety of all."
