OL,3,CWhat does Nigel Farage's by-election
OL,4,Cwin mean for probe into his finances?
OL,6,FHas the investigation gone away?
OL,8,FThe parliamentary investigation into
OL,9,FFarage's finances was paused when he
OL,10,Fstood down as an MP, but resumed on
OL,11,FFriday morning.
OL,13,FFarage will be sworn in again when
OL,14,Fparliament returns from its summer
OL,15,Frecess, on September 1.
OL,17,FWhat happens if Farage is found to
OL,18,Fhave breached the rules?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
