OL,3,CWhat does Nigel Farage's by-election
OL,4,Cwin mean for probe into his finances?
OL,6,FThe Parliamentary Standards Committee
OL,7,Fdoes not have the power to directly
OL,8,Fpunish rulebreakers, but can recommend
OL,9,Fcourses of action for the prime
OL,10,Fminister to take, the most severe of
OL,11,Fwhich is a suspension from parliament
OL,12,Fas an MP.
OL,14,FIf this suspension lasts for longer
OL,15,Fthan 10 days, a recall petition can be
OL,16,Ftriggered in that MP's constituency,
OL,17,Fwhich would mean another by-election
OL,18,Ffor Clacton.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
