OL,3,CWhat does Nigel Farage's by-election
OL,4,Cwin mean for probe into his finances?
OL,6,FAll of the major parties have
OL,7,Findicated they would field candidates
OL,8,Fif this were to happen.
OL,10,FA recall petition successfully
OL,11,Ftriggers a by-election if 10% of the
OL,12,Fregistered electorate in that
OL,13,Fconstituency sign it.
OL,15,FFarage has continually argued that he
OL,16,Fhas not breached any rules, as the #5
OL,17,Fmillion gift was given to him in a
OL,18,Fpersonal capacity before he was an MP.
OL,20,FAre there any other investigations?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/14
