OL,3,CWhat does Nigel Farage's by-election
OL,4,Cwin mean for probe into his finances?
OL,6,FAs well as the parliamentary
OL,7,Finvestigation, questions have also
OL,8,Fbeen raised about Farage's involvement
OL,9,Fwith convicted fraudster George
OL,10,FCottrell.
OL,12,FLong-time aide Cottrell is reported to
OL,13,Fhave provided funding for multiple
OL,14,Faspects of Farage's operation ahead of
OL,15,Fhis election, including for staffing,
OL,16,Fsecurity and housing, according to The
OL,17,FSunday Times.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31913
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786753075
OL,3,CWhat does Nigel Farage's by-election
OL,4,Cwin mean for probe into his finances?
OL,6,FThe newspaper said Cottrell recruited
OL,7,Fand paid three staff to work on
OL,8,FFarage's social media before the
OL,9,Fgeneral election, and has continued to
OL,10,Fallow him to use a five-story Georgian
OL,11,Ftownhouse he rented near Buckingham
OL,12,FPalace.
OL,14,FThe Parliamentary Standards Committee
OL,15,Fhas not confirmed whether it is
OL,16,Finvestigating the claims, but Reform
OL,17,Fhas insisted "no rules have been
OL,18,Fbroken" as it was before Farage became
OL,19,Fan MP.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
